        ///     function is only valid during contact callbacks: - During the ContactListener::OnContactAdded callback
        ///     this function can be used to determine if a different contact pair between the bodies was active in the
        ///     previous simulation step (function returns true) or if this is the first step that the bodies are
        ///     touching (function returns false). - During the ContactListener::OnContactRemoved callback this function
        ///     can be used to determine if this is the last contact pair between the bodies (function returns false) or
